  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "If two distinct chords drawn from the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>)</mo></math> on the circle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>y</mi></math> (where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>) are bisected by the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi></math>-axis, then",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "b3mlx",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "asxam",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "TAhvl",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "SonqO",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>)</mo></math> be the other end of the chord drawn from the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>)</mo></math> on the circle</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p>Their mid-point is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>since, mid-point lies on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi></math>-axis i.e. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Also, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>)</mo></math> lies on the circle.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>From Eqs. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo></math>, we get <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Which is quadratic in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math> such that, Discriminant <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
